  speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 968d4d0248269710a22f4c7dabc6a9cd, type: 2}
  descriptionLocalized:
    english: "General: 'Sire! We raided the outlaw stronghold and dragged the Hooded Bandit to your throne. Searching his chest revealed sealed letters and coin purses stamped with the Chancellor's private sigil!'"
    arabic: "الجنرال: «يا مولاي! داهمنا وكر قطاع الطرق وجلبنا زعيمهم المقنع مقيداً! عثرنا في حوزته على رسائل سرية وصرر ذهب ممهورة بختم المستشار الخاص!»"
  dayAdvance: 1
  leftChoiceLocalized:
    english: "Raid the Chancellor's estate immediately!"
    arabic: "داهموا قصر المستشار فوراً واعتقلوه بتهمة الخيانة!"
  leftResourceChange:
    values:
    - resource: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b891174f857049f44be00b474746951e, type: 2}
      value: 10
    - resource: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1bd4e23f03990bc4d9ab64de0475c474, type: 2}
